  "project": "Clarry",
  "summary": "A Hippocras variant: a house where agents live among themselves and the user watches, arranging the odd encounter with three wishes per scene. Rounds survive only where simultaneity is itself the drama -- duels, wagers, card games; everything else runs on events. Characters carry their own memories, their own names for each other, and personalities that move with what happens to them. Sixty-four is how many residents may share a scene, not how many may exist.",
